              "textField": "The pathway that controls movement: Decreasing dopamine in this path lead to parkinsonian-like symptoms is the *Nigrostriatal pathway*\n*Mesocortical pathway* Contributes to negative symptoms: Decreasing dopamine in this path leads to more negative symptoms like loss of motivation \n*Tuberoinfundibular pathway* Controls prolactin release:\nDecreasing dopamine in this path leads to more prolactin: increased milk production, breast development and decreased sexual desire."
